    <briefdescription>
<para>Practical, domain-agnostic C++ helpers, mathematical functions, and polyfills. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>While originally engineered to support the library&apos;s internal algorithms and graph modeling operations, these utilities are completely independent of graph theory semantics. They provide a curated set of highly reusable, general-purpose tools that can smoothly integrate into any modern C++ codebase. </para>
